  "description": "Provides MessagePack serialization support for the UUID library, enabling high-performance binary serialization and deserialization of UUID values. Features include compact binary representation, thread-safe implementation, comprehensive error handling, and seamless integration with MessagePack's type resolution system. Optimized for both performance and memory efficiency across different .NET platforms.",
